This is a placeholder for the actual gradle-wrapper.jar file.
In a real Android project, this file would be downloaded by Gradle.
For the purpose of this project structure, we include this placeholder.

The actual gradle-wrapper.jar can be obtained by running:
  gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.2

Or by downloading it from:
  https://services.gradle.org/distributions/gradle-8.2-bin.zip
